   CONVERGENCE FLOWS — structural CSS
   Loaded AFTER ../e7-prototype.css, whose :root tokens (--e7-*) and primitive
   classes (.btn/.field/.pill/.card/.row-item/.e7-panel-host/.e7-modal/…) are
   reused verbatim. This file adds ONLY the structure the Experience Contract
   demands that the e7 shell lacks:
     · Region 2 context row (Rule 6 four-region anatomy)
     · FB-style Signal composer: capture-first, text-primary, compact pills
       (Rule 8 / audit item 1)
     · grouped `@` fuzzy dropdown with visible type badges — Person/Team/BU only
