  /* Mandatory on all money/%/counts/deltas/ages (DESIGN.md Tabular-Numbers Rule).
     Money is Inter-tabular, NEVER mono (DESIGN.md OD-P3-9 / The Mono-For-Identifiers
     Rule — SF Mono is reserved for IDs/codes/⌘K only). DM Sans's "tnum" is a verified
     no-op in its @fontsource build (2026-06-18), so this scope engages the sanctioned
     Inter-tabular fallback instead — numeric-only, never body/UI text. */
  .tabular {
    font-family: var(--font-tabular);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    font-feature-settings: "tnum";
  }
}

